{"seq":3,"slug":"logic-methodology","title":"逻辑学与方法论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology","introMarkdown":"# 逻辑学与方法论 简介\n\n逻辑学与方法论是哲学研究最基本的思维工具，为论证的有效性提供严格的形式标准，为哲学探究提供系统的分析方法。对于研究生而言，扎实的逻辑训练能够提升论文论证的严密性，而对哲学方法的掌握则是开展原创性哲学研究的前提。\n\n本课程从形式逻辑的基础系统出发，拓展到哲学逻辑的前沿分支，经由论证理论的实践训练，最终进入哲学方法论的专题讨论，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**形式逻辑**奠定严格推理的形式基础。命题逻辑建立真值函数运算的基本框架，谓词逻辑引入量化和个体变项来处理更复杂的推理结构，模态逻辑则将必然性与可能性纳入形式分析的范围。\n\n第二章**哲学逻辑**在经典逻辑的基础上发展出面向特定哲学问题的扩展系统。认识论逻辑形式化知识和信念的推理规则，道义逻辑处理规范和义务的推理，亚相容逻辑则探索在矛盾信息下仍能进行有意义推理的可能性。\n\n第三章**论证理论**从形式系统转向日常语言和学术写作中的论证实践。论证结构的分析方法、常见谬误的识别与诊断、以及辩证论辩的规范框架，为学习者提供在学术交流中评估和构建论证的实用技能。\n\n第四章**哲学方法论专题**汇集哲学研究中最重要的方法论工具。概念分析追求术语的精确界定，思想实验通过假想情境检验理论直觉，诠释学则为理解文本和意义提供系统的方法论框架。\n\n建议学习者在形式逻辑部分多做推导练习，在论证理论和方法论部分结合实际哲学文本进行分析实践。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formal-logic","title":"形式逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/formal-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"propositional-logic","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 命题逻辑","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/formal-logic/propositional-logic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"predicate-logic","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 谓词逻辑","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/formal-logic/predicate-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modal-logic","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 模态逻辑","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/formal-logic/modal-logic"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"philosophical-logic","title":"哲学逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/philosophical-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"epistemic-logic","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 认识论逻辑","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/philosophical-logic/epistemic-logic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deontic-logic","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 道义逻辑","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/philosophical-logic/deontic-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"paraconsistent-logic","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 亚相容逻辑","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/philosophical-logic/paraconsistent-logic"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"argumentation","title":"论证理论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"argument-structures","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 论证结构","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/argument-structures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fallacies-analysis","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 谬误分析","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/fallacies-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dialectical-argumentation","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 辩证论辩","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/dialectical-argumentation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"methodology-seminar","title":"哲学方法论专题","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/methodology-seminar","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conceptual-analysis","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 概念分析","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/methodology-seminar/conceptual-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thought-experiments","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 思想实验","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/methodology-seminar/thought-experiments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hermeneutics","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 诠释学","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/methodology-seminar/hermeneutics"}]}]}